{"generated": "2026-11-11 18:15", "brief": "<b>1. 앤트로픽 IPO 추진과 글로벌 AI 투자 시장 동향</b>\n글로벌 AI 스타트업 앤트로픽이 최대 1,000억 달러 규모의 역사적인 상장을 추진하면서 국내외 금융시장과 반도체 업계의 관심이 집중되고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTFBub1ozMkNfS3RYWXFCQlU5aVZFdmV4OVR4bE1aRzB2VGRCcmREUExSY2F4XzJfdVFzS0JPTzNXS1RGM3RVSDhzajlTYjVNYW8?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#12</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#26</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQVlNQN2I1clZBcGZoT3dTRmRaQndHY3VVNnp2RVdiVWk3b2ZHRWNXUEQ4RnN4WV9CN0FwdXVMbjN0TlJNMU5Gc2JGN2ZLdTV0Rjd2NE1mM1l0N3lJbENDOVhNQ3FadWp5ZE5UREJMNWdzTzdkYTFzdHVNNW13djZEcDJGYzc1T1pOeUcwTDh3Y0F5Nk9pVFFWMVg0cmxFVUx2?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#37</a>]. 시장에서는 이번 IPO가 AI 거품론을 검증하고 국내 반도체 기업들의 HBM 수요 확대 등 실적에 미칠 영향을 예의주시하고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVkFVX3lxTE8ta0ZiUnFzeEtFVjhJS2NFSFdQaUFOSUs3YmJIM0Z0QjB5cG9RMjJBeEtiRnRBeHAxUGZuakE0LUNDWTRJdy1qc0hZVDR5MmR3RW8tbjVn?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#16</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVEFVX3lxTE1lQnVINVRKM1RtWXRSb1NjTl9jVDl2dThwNEsySDdvNENwLVJCbk5TMUJlQU4wZ3dRYUlxcGpxd19ZSFE0VkRpRnFBSGtEUXVUb0tNVg?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#33</a>].\n\n<b>2. 자본시장 유상증자 및 IPO 시장 양극화</b>\n삼성바이오로직스는 CDMO 경쟁력에 힘입어 구주주 청약률 97%를 기록하며 성공적으로 유상증자를 진행한 반면, 뷰노와 빅텐츠 등은 증자 일정이 연기되거나 철회되었습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxNcTY0b3pSS0YzVFR5akpMY3VmbFJ1RXh6WEZneHdZNE1LS1NmNmI2SjZDZVFKY1l4OTdBZ096NXNPS2w1YjNkd29KNUlYR2I5MmloYkhOX0FDRmFxX0J5NTJSWXEySnoyWGxKSHpUa3hXeWpkcFBhNDRLRlEwbzRnSXN5MDFlTkRF?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#14</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMia0FVX3lxTE5zNXNSeFlNUy0xNkFMdXJuMUtaZlE5WkNxUlJJcVdvdEVOZVRtT3VFd1lhNm9LUjJRVGljVW9qMW1EWXpWWkdEc1BCVHlaNjhOWjlIeDFObWtJQUVDWEhoLVRnRlhjM29mVTd3?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#18</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTFA0S3R3dDl4ZWJUaGJpUlg1Y2lHNy1NZ2Ztam83WENBNWktLXVYRG1hbnd4Y3lqa25NS2ZOdC1TWnZKLWp5TVYtQUdQSlpjNXNWZ0pONW1Yc3B5RGs?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#34</a>]. 또한 IBK투자증권과 대신증권이 IPO 시장 공략에 박차를 가하는 가운데, 제이앤티지와 씨앤엠은 기업가치 평가 문제로 일반청약을 앞두고 상장을 철회하는 등 시장 내 양극화가 심화되고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#21</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTE5Yd1hnWXNOeHhaNDZVU2luR25OWW5iTUpoSGRRbGV3b1JlNGhkU3Z5NzlDdGZmVUtTRWcwWS0zUkF0MGF4YVdiX2hDWlI0MVpvR1JMcHFfX25HTmJVUEJ5SUVzbXczemxv?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#22</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTE44ZzgxbDhBR05HZWpiczk5NWlzWVRXeVoycFdzSGFrSlMxMXR1bkNkSG9hbUFGLXNYOGxlSExLSTRFTUQ3U3lNZnVpaHUyYjczcWNDRklzOUtWNWVlV3JjQjBQUHduZVZV?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#25</a>].\n\n<b>3. 상장사 경영권 분쟁 및 자금 조달 리스크 확대</b>\n오스코텍은 창업주 장남의 이사회 진입을 둘러싸고 경영권 갈등을 겪고 있으며, 한진칼우 등 관련 우선주가 급등락하는 변동성을 보이고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiTkFVX3lxTE53TlIzdjFVelh0TDB0NzZiSDg5cnVRcHBvdDJ6cXVGX3ZxdTBfMW5oQUtGM2RVSVI5SnotT1lnYWlZYnU3bmd4cmg5SmlFdw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#30</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTE04T2ZFd1JPRUdVY3RXV1VlSHpidmRSS09KTHEtams3X21RcGxzS2NDRE9vTWVtNGVGOHVDLTZ1cFdERWVfSzZRLUcwbmZnbU1uZjBBclcxeHNCR2p1WmRaWm1XNllRQkN3bDUzYnNoYw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#32</a>]. 한편 신테카바이오, 더코디, 빅텐츠 등 일부 상장사들은 전환사채(CB) 발행 및 재매도 철회 과정에서 현금성 자산 부족과 주식 가치 희석에 따른 유동성 리스크가 부각되고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBkMDhjZWM0bTJxeG4xb0hQd2gwVVN0ZHFJQ2hhcGw5bFQ3NHozYXpkalpLU09vYTVsdVBjWUNIcXAxblBzNHdYYnhlMFFYT216X0J1eE5fcl9HMlZGQWc?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#31</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTFA0S3R3dDl4ZWJUaGJpUlg1Y2lHNy1NZ2Ztam83WENBNWktLXVYRG1hbnd4Y3lqa25NS2ZOdC1TWnZKLWp5TVYtQUdQSlpjNXNWZ0pONW1Yc3B5RGs?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#34</a> <a href=\"